    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b32e8b2e8b7adcbebbbaa21d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后我又不时目击了几次她做出\n令人难以理解的举动……不过她仍然坚持\n不打算说出到底在做什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2db24c3df7cdeeb922a436804eaed8bc8d33550c2f3a07e9b4b102202b846aa6",
