    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f64e2de7dcfeffc6997a6f84",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真弓快车时时刻刻带在身上的笔记本\n此刻正放在桌上。她忘了带走吗？\n该送去给她吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d94572ba03b98052a60495dc0baae999e806e44f68cd6a9a709c81680b37744",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
